        "Longhi et al., 2013, BMC Plant Biology",
        "Costa et al., 2010, J Exp Botany",
        "Ru et al., 2021"
      ],
      "breeding_notes": "Alleles 289 and 292 are favorable for firmness. The 298:298 genotype should be avoided for breeding firm-textured cultivars. Best combined with ACS and ACO for comprehensive texture prediction."
